window.products.push({"id":130070,"name":"Upgraded W10528947 Washer Basket Driven Hub Kit by Sikawai Fit for Whirl-pool Ken-more Cro-sley Washing Machine Hub Replaces W10396887 AP5665171 PS601","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d6XA1UePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ Upgrade Your Washing Machine: The Sikawai W10528947 Washer Basket Driven Hub Kit is the perfect replacement for your old, worn-out hub kit. This kit is compatible with Cro-sley, In-glis, Ken-more, Whirl-pool, Am-ana, Ad-miral, and more. ✔️ High-Quality Materials: Made from durable materials and rigorously tested by the manufacturer, this kit is built to last. ✔️Perfect Fit：Replaces W10528947, W10528947VP, W10396887, AP5665171, 2684908, PS6012095, EAP6012095. ✔️ Easy to Install: With simple installation instructions, you can easily replace your old hub kit and get your washing machine running smoothly again. ✔️ 1-Year Warranty: We stand behind our products and offer a 1-year warranty and 30-day return and exchange policy. Contact us with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d6XA1UePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sikawai","source_asin":"B08C9L9RN9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9L9RN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9L9RN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":130071,"name":"Frigidaire EFIC108-SILVER Counter top Portable, 26 lb per Day Ice Maker Machine, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lRw3I2HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY - Its reservoir is located beneath the ice basket and can produce up to 26 Lbs of clear ice cubes per day. EFFICIENT & EASY TO USE - In less than 6 minutes, you can make perfectly squared ice cubes and store up to 2.2 Lbs. at a time. The user-friendly & straightforward electronic controls will have you making ice cubes in no time. VERSATILE - You have a choice to make Ice Cubes in three different sizes ( small, medium & large) MODERN DESIGN - Stainless Steel Ice Maker with a large transparent window allows for process monitoring. FUNCTIONALITY - When the basket is full, our ice maker indicators will remind you to take out the ice cubes, and when the ice maker is low on water, they will alert you to add more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lRw3I2HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B01ECZVWAU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ECZVWAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ECZVWAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":130072,"name":"Dryer Heating Element for Samsung DC47-00019A & DC47-00018A DC96-00887A DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse Kit fits DV48H7400EW/A2 DV40J3000EW/A2 DV45H7000EW/A2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611IgYhm0cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The instructions work for most Samsung dryers, some may have some small differences. Here is how to replace the DC47-00019A heating element: STEP1: Shut off the power to the dryer before working on it. STEP2: Remove the two screws securing the top panel to the back of the dryer. Slide the top panel towards the back of the dryer to remove. You will need to remove the front control panel, some model have screws securing this. Remove them and pull up to remove, you should have enough extra wire to set the control panel on top of the dryer to get it out of the way. if not, then disconnect the wires and set it off to the side. Behind where the control panel was there will be four screws that secure the front panel of the dryer to the frame. Remove these four screws. STEP3: Open the door of the dryer, there will be two screws that need to be removed at the bottom of the door frame area. With those two screws removed you should be able to tilt the front panel forward, remove the connector to the door switch, and remove the front panel. STEP4: The heating element is located on the bottom right side of the dryer. To remove the element you will need to remove the wires to the heating element, thermal fuse, and thermostat. Then remove the mounting screw in the front and the whole heating element assembly should pull out the front of the dryer. STEP5: Remove assembly and replace the DC47-00019A heating element. To re-install the heating element you will need to put everything back in the reverse order. To test the heating element, you will need an Ohm meter or multi-meter. A good heating element should read approximately 9-10 ohms. A burned out element will have an infinite resistance, it won’t register anything.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611IgYhm0cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTNTVEN","source_asin":"B07TG193L8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TG193L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TG193L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
