window.products.push({"id":130257,"name":"Homtone Gas Cooktop 34 Inch, Built-in Gas Stove 5 Burners, Propane Gas Cooktop 36004 BTU Total, NG/LPG Convertible Hob for Apartments and Indoor Use, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":309.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NtKWhCo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[5 Versatile Cooking Burners] With 5 sealed gas burners, this recessed gas cooktop contains total maximum power reaching 36004BTU: auxiliary burner: 3413BTU, semi rapid burner: 5972BTU, rapid burner: 9385BTU, triple ring burner: 11262BTU. To meet multiple cooking requirements, each burner provides even heat distribution. [Stainless Steel Hob Surface] Featuring 0.6 mm brushed 304 stainless steel finish on the cooker panel to resist corrosion for long time usage, this Homtone 5 burners gas stove makes cleaning effortless and looks modern. [Drop-in Installation] For a harmonious kitchen arrangement, there is a built-in stove which is space saving and easy to clean. It is convenient to match with other utensils in kitchen to create comfortable cooking environment. The dimension of the product is 870 x 500 x 100mm, 34 x 20 x 3.95 inches and built-in Size is 840 x 480mm, 33 x 18.9 inches. [Flame Failure Detection] To ensure the automatic shutoff of the gas when the flame goes out accidently, the gas burner contains FFD thermocouples which also helps to avoid the gas leakage and provides safety while cooking. It is suitable for multi-purpose use such as family cooking, mobile home, RVs, small kitchen and indoor use. [NG/LPG Convertible and Quality Certification] The preset natural gas can be switched to liquefied gas as needed with the help of gas conversion kit which is included in the package. 2 gas supply option makes cooking convenient and can work manually w/o electricity. It is compatible to install the gas stove above a built-in oven. Hometone gas stove holds a certification of CSA. In case of any problem or doubt, you can contact the support team anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NtKWhCo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homtone","source_asin":"B0CDPT53VN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CDPT53VN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CDPT53VN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
