window.products.push({"id":130458,"name":"Kenmore 5.3 cu. ft. Top Load Washer in White, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cenl7rNQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Laundry day is a snap with the Kenmore 5.3 Cubic Foot Top Load Washer. From a sleek modern design to powerful cleaning technology, this Kenmore washing machine is perfect for busy families with a ton of laundry to do. Toss in a huge hamper of clothes, a small pile of delicates, or that bulky load of towels. This washer can handle almost any sized load with ease. Tackle laundry with this chic Kenmore top load washer and spend the rest of your day doing what you enjoy. Here are some tips to avoid white residue while washing. Use liquid HE detergent to the first line of the cap. If using HE powder detergent or pods make sure to add it to the tub before adding clothes to allow it to dissolve properly. Do not overload the machine. Use a cycle other than “Normal” like “Heavy Duty” or “Bulky” while avoiding “Express” when necessary. Use the “Deep Fill” option and/or the “Fabric Softener” option, if available, as these options will add more water to the cycle. Use cooler water temperatures, but not “tap cold” as detergent requires 60 degree water to dissolve. Add up to 2 extra rinses. Additional notes include using the clean washer cycle if the washer is not new. If these tips do not fix the issue, a service technician should be called to evaluate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cenl7rNQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B0824W8SH4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0824W8SH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0824W8SH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
