window.products.push({"id":130608,"name":"Upgrade DC31-00178A PX3516-01 Washer Drain Pump Motor (OEM) by Beaquicy - Replace DC31-00178D B35-3a AP5916591 for SAMSUNG Washer wf45r6300av/us, wa48","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h4qPOu0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑶𝑬𝑴 𝑫𝑪𝟑𝟏-𝟎𝟎𝟏𝟕𝟖𝑨 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑷𝑼𝑴𝑷 𝑴𝑶𝑻𝑶𝑹】The OEM DC31-00178A DC31-00178D Washer Drain Pump is used to remove water from the washer in the drain part of the cycle. It has a power of 120V, 60Hz, 80W. The DC31-00178A OEM Washer Drain Pump is composed of a motor, a pump body, an impeller, and a fan blade. ➤Samsung Drain Pump PX3516-01 can solve the FOLLOWING washing machine PROBLEMS: Washer can’t drain. Slow drainage. Washer pump not spin. Washer leaks. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 & 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳】The DC31-00178A DC31-00178D Samsung Washer Drain Pump Motor is made of high-quality durable METAL and ABS PLASTIC that prevents cracking during the use process,it can improve your laundry efficiency. The pump is an OEM product with upgraded materials, stronger joints, less likely to leak, less prone to breakage. ➤If the washer is displaying error codes such as 5E, SE and Sud, replace the DC31-00178A Washer Drain Pump promptly to ensure proper operation. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】The DC31-00178A PX3516-01 Washing Machine Drain Pump is a genuine OEM part, fits Samsung front-load and top-load washers. ➤DC31-00178A DC31-00178D Samsung Drain Pump replaces: PX3516-01, 3989917, 4958525, AP6977256, AP5916591, PS9605762, EAP9605762, DC31-00187A, etc. ➤DC31-00178A Samsung Water Pump compatible : WA400PJHDWR/AA, WA40J3000AW/A2, WF42H5200AP/A2, WA456DRHDSU/AA, WF42H5000AW/A2, WF42H5200AF/A2, WA52J8700AP/A2, WF56H9110CW/A2, WA45H7000AW/A2, etc. 【𝟓 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】DC31-00178A DC31-00178D Drain Pump Samsung Washer supports 5 years return and exchange. ➤The plastic part of the OEM DC31-00178A B35-3a washer drain pump, made of ABS plastic, is stronger and more durable, and the joints of the pump parts are more firmly connected so that they do not disintegrate easily during transport or use. The metal parts are made with an added anti-rust technical treatment, making the pump less prone to rust, extending its service life. 【𝑭𝑰𝑻𝑺 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳𝑺】The DC31-00178A Washer Drain Pump is suitable for following models: wa52j8700ap/a2, wf56h9100aw/a2, wf45h6300ag/a2, wf56h9110cw/a2, wa56h9000aw/a2, wa48j7700aw/aa, wa48j7700aw/a2, wa48h7400aw/a2, wa48j7770ap/aa, wa48j7770ap/a2, wa40j3000aw/aa, wa40j3000aw/a2, wa400pjhdwr/aa, wa456drhdwr/aa, wa45h7000ap/aa, wa456drhdsu/aa, wb09h7300gp/a1, wb09h7300gw/a1, wf42h5000aw/a2, wf42h5200af/a2, wf42h5200ap/a2, wf42h5200aw/a2, wf42h5400af/a2, wf42h5600ap/a2, wf42h5600aw/a2, etc. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】The installation of pump motor px3516-01 of washer is simple. You need a screwdriver and work gloves ready. Wear gloves and cut off power and water before you start. First pull out the control panel from the top, then open the drain pipe and drain the excess water. Remove the old drain pump and replace it new with pump motor DC31-00178A. Finally, re-fix the top panel and the repair is complete. Saving you energy, time and money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h4qPOu0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0882PCXG5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0882PCXG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0882PCXG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
