window.products.push({"id":130756,"name":"Cadco XAF-133 Half Size Convection Oven with Manual Controls and Humidity, 208-240-Volt/2700-Watt, Stainless/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1616.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VOv9XS5L._SL1000_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN ESSENTIAL - The XAF-133 is a heavy-duty oven with a strong stainless-steel construction, ensuring durability and reliability. Its heavy-duty door and hinge construction further enhance its robustness. Equipped with a high-temperature ball-bearing motor, this oven is designed for long-lasting and consistent performance. Incorporated with a LED light in the door to provide enhanced visibility and convenience while cooking or checking on the food inside the oven. COOK TO PERFECTION - A smart choice for any commercial kitchen that requires high-quality and efficient cooking. The oven has an advanced airflow design that circulates more air in less time, resulting in uniform and rapid cooking. The oven also has manual controls that allow you to set the time, temperature and heat settings to suit your preferences. You can select from 175 to 500 F to perform various cooking functions, such as baking, roasting, broiling or warming. CAPACITY - The Cadco XAF-133 oven has a spacious cooking chamber that can accommodate up to four half size sheet pans. The dimensions of the cooking chamber are 10\"H x 19-1/2\"W x 15-1/2\"D (1.75 cu. ft.), which gives you enough room to cook large batches of food. The oven also comes with 4 wire shelves that can be adjusted to different positions. SAFETY - The Cadco XAF-133 oven is not only efficient and durable, but also safe and comfortable to use. The oven has a “cool-touch\" double wall glass door that prevents heat from escaping and protects you from burns. The oven cavity is wrapped in high “R” value insulation that keeps the oven temperature stable and reduces energy consumption. SPECS / CERTIFICATIONS - Cadco XAF-133 heavy-duty oven offers powerful performance with its 208-240 voltage range, 2700 Watts power rating, and 20 Amps electrical connection. Its NEMA 6-20P plug enables easy installation. With UL and CSA certifications, this oven provides a safe and reliable cooking solution. Trust in the XAF-133 to deliver exceptional cooking results while prioritizing durability, functionality, and compliance with industry standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VOv9XS5L._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cadco","source_asin":"B0027AL6W2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027AL6W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0027AL6W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
