window.products.push({"id":130810,"name":"Magic Chef HMDR1000WE 10.1 cu.ft. top Freezer/Refrigerator, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bwwL2FVKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Magic Chef 10.1 cu. ft. top Freezer Refrigerator is the perfect in-between cooling machine more spacious than a mini but more compact than a regular household unit. It is a suitable appliance for smaller kitchens, break rooms, office kitchenettes or anywhere with space constraints. It occupies a small footprint but offers numerous cold-storage options for foods and beverages, including a glass-covered crisper to keep produce fresh. It's equipped with two adjustable-height glass shelves in the refrigerator and one slide-out wire shelf in the freezer, with several other storage options built into the reversible doors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bwwL2FVKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Chef","source_asin":"B0797R7S2T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0797R7S2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0797R7S2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":130811,"name":"EdgeStar Portable Pink Ice Maker Benefiting Susan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XVN037zZL._AC_.jpg","description":"In honor of Breast Cancer Awareness Month, Living Direct, Inc. has partnered with Susan G. Komen for the Cure , the world's leading breast cancer organization, to release a special limited edition version of their EdgeStar brand portable ice maker. The EdgeStar Portable Pink Ice Maker Benefiting Komen for the Cure (IP210PKSD) is being released to support the organization's mission to end breast cancer in the U.S. and throughout the world through ground-breaking research, community health outreach, advocacy and programs in more than 50 countries. Living Direct, Inc is proud to support Komen's mission to end breast cancer with this special edition product. The EdgeStar portable pink ice maker with electronic controls allows you to make ice anywhere you can plug it in. This ice maker is easy to use: just pour water into the internal reservoir, plug this portable ice maker in to any 110 volt outlet, and have ice within six (6) to ten (10) minutes. This countertop ice maker produces up to 28 pounds of ice per day, and stores up to 2 pounds of ice in an insulated storage compartment. This makes it easier to store and save up ice for entertaining guests or throwing parties, so no one will have to wait for the ice to be made to enjoy cold beverages. No drain is required for this ice maker, and you can select the ice cube size out of three (3) options. With all of these wonderful features, this ice maker is perfect for any kitchen, office, or anywhere you need ice at your fingertips, and it comes with a handy ice scoop. Special Limited Edition: Living Direct Inc. is proud to stand by the efforts of the Susan G Komen movement with this EdgeStar special edition pink ice maker Easy-To-Use Electronic Controls: Simple controls allow ice within minutes without constantly sending you to the user manual Compact Size: Standing under 15 high, this compact ice maker is ideal for countertop use whether you're in the kitchen or at the wet bar Wrapped","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XVN037zZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EdgeStar","source_asin":"B009WVHNSA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009WVHNSA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B009WVHNSA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
