window.products.push({"id":130884,"name":"(2023 Upgrade) 4Pcs DC97-16350E Washer Suspension Rods by Beaquicy - Replaces DC97-05280W,DC97-16350U,DC97-16350S - Fits Samsung WA45H7000AW WA50R5400","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zap55eMRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 PACK DC97-16350E WASHER SUSPENSION ROD】-- The DC97-16350E Washing Machine Suspension Support Rod is a shock absorber that supports the drum of the washing machine, allowing it to move while helping to reduce vibration in spin mode, reduce noise and keep the washing machine stable. The DC97-16350E Suspension Rods has a length of 26.2 inches.►If one or more of the suspension rods break, the washing machine will vibrate or shake and error codes such as UR, UB, UE will appear on the panel. 【ABS PLASTIC AND STAINLESS STEEL MATERIAL】-- The 4 Pack DC97-16350E Suspension Rods are made of high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel material for excellent durability and firmness. The high quality material makes the suspension bar less prone to breakage, deformation, wear and corrosion resistance in the process of reducing vibration, providing you with long-term stable and excellent performance.The suspension rods are greased to provide lubrication and at the same time to better reduce the vibration of the washing machine and extend the life of the rods. 【3 YEARS WARRANTY】-- The DC97-16350E Samsung Washer Suspension Rod support 3 YEARS return and exchange.►The washing machine vibrates during washing or spinning. The suspension rod absorbs the vibration energy by swaying along the boom itself, thus reducing the vibration and noise of the washing machine drum and allowing the machine to run smoothly even at high speeds. Package includes 4 x DC97-16350E Samsung Washer Suspension Rods. 【SAMSUNG WASHER】-- DC97-16350E Washer Suspension Rods replacement for Samsung washer.►Replace:DC97-16350U, DC97-16350C, DC97-16350S, DC97-16350D, DC97-16350J, DC97-16350K, DC97-16350T, DC97-05280W, DC97-05280H, DC97-05280K, DC97-05280X, DC97-18610B, DC97-18610C, AP5623264, AP5669739, PS4221572, PS4276369, B01AQHP6N2, EAP4276369, 3282689.►Compatible: WA45H7000AW/A2, WA5451ANW/XAA, WA484DSHAWR/A1, WA476DSHAWR/A1, WA45K7600AW/A2, WA45K7600AW/AA, WA45M3100AW/A4, WA45M7050AW/A4, WA45N3050AW/A4, WA50R5400AV/US, WA50R5400AW/US, WA50T5300AC, WA5451ANP/XAA, WA5471ABP/XAA, WA45H7000AW/A2, WA45H7200AP/A2, WA456DRHDWR/AA, WA45H7200AW/A2, WA45H7200AP/A2, WA400PJHDWR/AA, WA40A3005AW/A4, WA41A3000AW, etc. 【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of DC97-16350E Washer Suspension Support Rod is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power and water supply and put on working gloves to protect your hands. Take the washer apart, locate the suspension rod, disengage the rod from the slot and withdraw the bar and replace it with a new one. NOTE that when installing, ensure that the rod is oiled and lubricated to prevent the rod from subsequently being ineffective in reducing vibration and causing noise from the washing machine due to inadequate lubrication.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zap55eMRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0836GBL36","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836GBL36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836GBL36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
