window.products.push({"id":130900,"name":"PUREPLUS XWF Replacement (NOT XWFE) for GE WR17X30702, GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GWE19, GYE18, CFE26 French Door & Side ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hCx6tNOwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️Authoritative Certifications -The filter is certified against NSF/ANSI 42 and 372 Lead-Free by IAPMO, filtering out 99% Chlorine, odor and improve water taste significantly. It also certified by European TUV, ROHS, REACH, Canadian CSA, BPA Free and Australian Water Mark. Only select products with authoritative certifications for your loved ones. ❄️Innovated Multi-Layer Filtration Integrated Molding Tech - This Multi-layer technology offers different levels of filtration efficiency in filtering different contaminants. 0.5 Micron inner layer is effective against 99.99%Chlorine and meets Particular Reduction Class I standard. This filter retains beneficial minerals in water which is good to health. ❄️WHY PUREPLUS -PUREPLUS has 20 years of expertise and 200 patents in the water filtration industry. Every year it provides filtration solutions to more than 200 million family worldwide, uses advanced filtration technology to ensure high quality water. Trust us, make PUREPLUS your resolution. ❄️Strict Quality Control -All products are produced under the ISO9001 standard and inspected under strict quality control. Each filter is produced through 34 production processes, 400PSI pressure test, 10,000 water hammer tests, and 6 independent tests. ❄️Easy to Install -Delicate design to fit the original brand. Easy for installation and operation. ❄️Cost-Effective -PUREPLUS is the most cost-effective brand. It sells 600 million filters worldwide every year, and can provide you with the best filtration performance with a more reasonable price. ❄️About TDS -Our filter cannot abviously lower the TDS value because it filters harmful substances while keeping beneficial minerals such as potassium, calcium, sodium, and magnesium, which is the main component of inorganic salts. ❄️Fits GE Refrigerator -Select GE Bottom Freezer and Side-by-Side refrigerators manufactured after June 2018. Applicable to models starting with CFE26, CWE19, CZS22, GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GNE27ESMSS, GNE27JGMBB, GNE27JGMWW, GNE27JMMES, GNE27JSMSS, GSE23, GSE23G, GSE25, GSE26, GSS23, GSS25, GWE19, GYE18, GZS22, PSE25, QNE27, XFE26. ❄️Compatible Models - General electric XWF, CZS22M, GDE21E, GDE25E, GFE24J, GNE21F, GNE25J, GSE23G, GSE25G, GSE25H, GSE26G, GSS23G, GSS23H, GSS25G, GSS25L, GWE19J, GYE18J, GZS22D, GZS22I, PSE25K, PSS28K, PZS22MXWF, AQF-XWF, CF9, FL-RF48, GF-XWF, MB-XWF, PF9, WS648A. PUREPLUS is an independent brand. Our filter doesn't have an RFID chip.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hCx6tNOwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUREPLUS","source_asin":"B082XV6W9K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XV6W9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XV6W9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
