window.products.push({"id":130952,"name":"Siwdoy 279838 3387134 3977767 3392519 Dryer Heating Element Kit Compatible with Whirlpool Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YR+V9JMZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"279838 Heating Element is rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. 279838 heating element replacement for numbers 2438, 279837, 279838, 279838A, 279838VP, 3398064, 3403585, 8565582, AP3094254, W10724237. 3387134 Dryer Thermostat made to fit a variety of Whirlpool clothes dryers. May also fit other makes and models of clothes dryers. Dryer cycling thermostat with internal bias heater. Opens at 155F, closes at 130F. 3387134 thermostat Replaces part numbers AP3131939, PS344510, ET187, 3387139, 3387135 3977767 Dryer Thermostat is a hi-limit thermostat with Terminal Extension Arm. It acts as as safety mechanism that keeps the dryer from overheating. Once the dryer temperature reaches 221 degrees Farenheit, this piece will shut down power to the heating element until it drops by 80 degrees Farenheit 3977767 dryer thermostat replaces part numbers 3399693, WP3977767VP, AP3131941, 898078 3392519 dryer thermal fuse is used indryers as a safety mechanism that stops the flow of electricity to the motor circuit when a dryer overheats. This replacement part features two 3/16 inch terminals, and is sold individually. When this fuse is faulty, your dryer will not start or it will not heat properly. This is a one-time fuse, meaning it cannot be re-set. 3392519 dryer thermal fuse replaces part number 3388651, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, Roper, Maytag, Estate, Inglis, KitchenAid, Crosley, Amana, Admiral, Magic Chef. Package list: 1PC 279838 Dryer Heating Element 1PC 3977767 Dryer Thermostat 1PC 3387134 Dryer Thermostat 1PC 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse Siwdoy Customer Service Siwdoy is committed to providing each customer best customer service. if any question ,Please don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YR+V9JMZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siwdoy","source_asin":"B07G5PM5SL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-130952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5PM5SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5PM5SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
